{"id":"MOEX-113020-1301-Q073","title":"囊胚先脫離透明帶，才能著床","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med1","sourceSha256":"311766a008de4cd486451d5cf3ace651e21626ab07aac13eb730273a6bb8da80","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_b848a20b2aa881918b9ed1a6290c803d","sourceAnchor":"q73","shortHtml":"<p>答案是 <strong>D：已著床的囊胚</strong>。胚胎在著床前已完成<strong>孵化（hatching）</strong>，離開原本包覆它的透明帶，滋養層才得以直接接觸並附著子宮內膜。</p>","html":"<div><h2>囊胚先脫離透明帶，才能著床</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：D</p><p>答案是 <strong>D：已著床的囊胚</strong>。胚胎在著床前已完成<strong>孵化（hatching）</strong>，離開原本包覆它的透明帶，滋養層才得以直接接觸並附著子宮內膜。</p>\n<h3>透明帶陪伴早期卵裂，著床前才離開</h3>\n<p><strong>透明帶</strong>是卵母細胞外的糖蛋白層。它包覆次級卵母細胞，受精後仍留在受精卵外；隨著卵裂形成多個卵裂球，桑葚胚仍在這一層外殼之內。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1957px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.0920758928571428\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/8d09dd5b45da044175e1d9dfd502fa973e10207ac8d5de1ea8a546c0be7b92b8.jpg\" alt=\"受精、卵裂、桑葚胚、囊胚孵化與子宮內膜著床的順序\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1957\" height=\"1792\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/8d09dd5b45da044175e1d9dfd502fa973e10207ac8d5de1ea8a546c0be7b92b8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>受精後早期發育與進入子宮的順序。圖：OpenStax／Medicine LibreTexts，Pre-Embryonic Development；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>；<a href=\"https://med.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Anatomy_and_Physiology/Anatomy_and_Physiology_1e_(OpenStax)/Unit_6%3A_Human_Development_and_the_Continuity_of_Life/28%3A_Development_and_Inheritance/28.02%3A_Embryonic_Development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。完整原圖，未改標。</figcaption></figure>\n<p>沿左側受精卵、上方卵裂與桑葚胚，追到右上方囊胚，再看下方<strong>7：sheds zona pellucida</strong>，接著才是<strong>8：implants into endometrium</strong>。本題要看的關係是<strong>先脫離透明帶，再著床</strong>；圖中細胞數是發育階段的示意，不必用它當唯一判斷依據。</p>\n<h3>「囊胚」與「已著床囊胚」不能混成同一狀態</h3>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>選項階段</th><th>透明帶</th><th>辨認重點</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>A 次級卵母細胞</td><td>存在</td><td>卵母細胞外的糖蛋白包覆層</td></tr>\n<tr><td>B 受精卵</td><td>仍存在</td><td>受精使其性質改變，不是立即整層消失</td></tr>\n<tr><td>C 桑葚胚</td><td>仍存在</td><td>多個卵裂球仍被透明帶包住</td></tr>\n<tr><td>D 已著床囊胚</td><td>已脫離</td><td>孵化後滋養層可接觸子宮內膜</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>尚未孵化的早期囊胚仍可有透明帶，因此答案的關鍵字是<strong>implanted，已著床</strong>。右上囊胚剖面為了呈現內細胞群、囊胚腔與滋養層，沒有把所有外部包覆都畫出，不能只憑那個剖面就推論所有囊胚都沒有透明帶。</p>\n<h3>受精後的改變，不等於把透明帶立刻去掉</h3>\n<p>受精後的皮質反應會改變透明帶等受精相關結構，有助限制多精入卵；這是功能與性質的變化。之後胚胎擴張並孵化，才是本題所問透明帶不再包覆的階段。</p>\n<p>也要把透明帶與<strong>滋養層</strong>分開：前者是細胞外的外殼，後者是囊胚外層的細胞群，參與附著、侵入子宮內膜及後續胎盤形成。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（一）原題，第73題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：更正後答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/books/NBK554562/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Embryology, Week 1</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/books/NBK546679/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Embryology, Week 2-3</a></li><li><a href=\"https://med.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Anatomy_and_Physiology/Anatomy_and_Physiology_1e_(OpenStax)/Unit_6%3A_Human_Development_and_the_Continuity_of_Life/28%3A_Development_and_Inheritance/28.02%3A_Embryonic_Development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax／LibreTexts：早期胚胎發育原圖與授權</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":1,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：D"}